  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Craftable Heads</strong></span> 为生物和玩家头颅添加了合成配方。无需再依赖稀有掉落。</p>\n<p>现在你可以轻松合成头颅用于装饰、纪念品或活动。简单、轻量，非常适合生存模式与服务端使用！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aedaa40a-b103-4a6a-a96f-42b545915d36.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cdcf62d7-6f05-4f1a-b9af-127980240907.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e4c341d-d8f0-485e-b8c8-fa525e765f83.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_223d3c47-4ca6-4374-8a61-0a9d44839f05.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_862d69dd-4bf7-45a5-bd6c-523235d8f4bc.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2b0c692c-f4f1-4bd1-87bf-e9b6064c4839.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4227c7b3-4e96-4084-a6da-f978f90edd66.png\"></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>我的 Discord：rollsroyce0991</strong></span></p>",
